_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1311269006:0":{"text":"人間だった頃は何も成し遂げられず、今だって何もできずにいる。あなたの存在意義なんて、何一つないのよ。","source_cn":"至于你存在的意义？什么都没有。你还是人类的时候，什么都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DAFFD366214C250","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1311269007:0":{"text":"そうね……その通りよ……","source_cn":"……你……说得对。<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23016A22F3C369BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1311269008:0":{"text":"違います、ヴェリカさん！あんな言葉を真に受けちゃだめです！","source_cn":"瓦丽卡，她……她说得不对！你不能在这时候沮丧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3BAE8DBDE6F83FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1311269009:0":{"text":"いいえ……二千年もの間、ずっと同じ悪夢を見てきたわ。私は悔しかった、だからグレイヴボーンになった。でも、それで私は何を得たの？","source_cn":"不……两千年……这样的噩梦我已经做了两千年了。我不甘心...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6F9410071F790C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1311269010:0":{"text":"私を信じ、共に不死者となり、挙げ句の果てに生きた屍となった戦友たち？","source_cn":"信任我、追随我成为亡灵，最后却沦为活死人，被人厌弃的战友？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x946288121BB577BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_